      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        444.2776794433594,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "(regardless of A1c), substance use disorders and mental illness could be enrolled.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.4376831054688,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "Individuals with MDR/RR-TB who have had less than 1 month of previous exposure to any of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.2660522460938,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "component medicines of the regimen (apart from PZA, where prior exposure is permitted; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4234008789062,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "quinolones, where resistance should be excluded), are eligible for treatment with these regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.5022583007812,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "Additionally, the treatment programme may enrol children and adolescents who do not have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.4155883789062,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "bacteriological confirmation of TB or defined resistance patterns but are deemed to have a high",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.3936157226562,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "likelihood of MDR/RR-TB, based on clinical signs and symptoms of TB and a history of contact with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        221.0952911376953,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "a confirmed MDR/RR-TB patient.",
