      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        212.33863830566406,
        213.38893127441406,
        227.99862670898438
      ],
      "text": "Drug susceptibility testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.2064971923828,
        527.4677734375,
        249.6494903564453
      ],
      "text": "A WHO-recommended rapid molecular test to confirm FQ susceptibility should be conducted before",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986541748046875,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        248.40650939941406,
        527.4409790039062,
        262.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "starting the treatment with the modified 9-month regimens. In settings where DST for other drugs in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        261.60650634765625,
        527.4453735351562,
        276.0495300292969
      ],
      "text": "the regimen can be done and resistance to any of the component medicines of the regimen (apart",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        274.8065185546875,
        466.1534423828125,
        289.2495422363281
      ],
      "text": "from PZA, discussed separately below) is confirmed, the regimens should not be used.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.5103759765625,
        527.3947143554688,
        310.9533996582031
      ],
      "text": "The endTB trial data suggested reduced efficacy among patients with PZA resistance. However, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        309.71038818359375,
        527.4353637695312,
        324.1534118652344
      ],
      "text": "best estimates suggested higher success rates than with the longer regimen, even in cases of PZA",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.910400390625,
        527.5654296875,
        337.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "resistance. Therefore, the GDG suggested that PZA can be dropped from the modified 9-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.11041259765625,
        527.59130859375,
        350.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "regimens if resistance to PZA is reliably confirmed or if there are PZA-associated AEs. However, if PZA",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98569107055664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.3103942871094,
        527.4322509765625,
        363.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "is discontinued, the rest of the regimen should continue as prescribed. In settings where PZA testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        362.5104064941406,
        452.9435119628906,
        376.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "is not widely available, PZA should be maintained unless there are PZA-related AEs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        393.35430908203125,
        305.2585754394531,
        409.0143127441406
      ],
      "text": "Adverse events and drug–drug interactions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.2221984863281,
        527.1956787109375,
        430.66522216796875
      ],
      "text": "For patients on treatment with modified 9-month regimens, it is essential to undertake active TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.4222106933594,
        527.4267578125,
        443.865234375
      ],
      "text": "drug-safety monitoring and management for close monitoring and adequately managing AEs and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.6221923828125,
        320.99847412109375,
        457.0652160644531
      ],
      "text": "preventing complications from drug–drug interactions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.3262023925781,
        527.3883056640625,
        478.76922607421875
      ],
      "text": "An important AE in patients using the modified 9-month regimens is hepatoxicity in relation to PZA.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.5262145996094,
        527.4736938476562,
        491.96923828125
      ],
      "text": "In the endTB trial, screening for elevation of liver enzymes was performed monthly throughout",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.7261962890625,
        527.6004028320312,
        505.1692199707031
      ],
      "text": "treatment, regardless of symptoms. Elevation in liver enzymes, with or without accompanying",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.92620849609375,
        527.4288330078125,
        518.3692016601562
      ],
      "text": "symptoms, occurred frequently during treatment. Grade 3 hepatotoxicity was defined in the trial as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.126220703125,
        527.3783569335938,
        531.5692138671875
      ],
      "text": "ALT (SGPT) or AST (SGOT) levels greater than five times but less than or equal to 10 times the upper",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.326171875,
        527.3849487304688,
        544.7691650390625
      ],
      "text": "limit of normal. Specifically, transient Grade 3 or higher hepatotoxicity occurred in 18% of patients in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.5262451171875,
        527.154296875,
        557.96923828125
      ],
      "text": "BLMZ, 16% in BLLfxCZ and 8.7% in BDLLfxZ in the safety population of the endTB trial. Imprecision in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.995099067687988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.7261962890625,
        527.197265625,
        571.169189453125
      ],
      "text": "these estimates meant that it was not possible to draw any firm conclusions about differences between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.9617338180542,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.9262084960938,
        527.2645263671875,
        584.3692016601562
      ],
      "text": "regimens. During the trial, suspension of PZA was recommended when liver enzyme levels exceeded",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994548797607422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.126220703125,
        527.3361206054688,
        597.5692138671875
      ],
      "text": "five times the upper limit of the upper limit normal (5×ULN). PZA was permanently discontinued in an",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980732917785645,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.326171875,
        527.3849487304688,
        610.7691650390625
      ],
      "text": "average of 17% of patients, with no significant differences among the three regimens. Most patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.5261840820312,
        527.4420166015625,
        623.9691772460938
      ],
      "text": "receiving the modified 9-month regimens received 39 weeks of PZA, and patients who permanently",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.7261962890625,
        527.5015258789062,
        637.169189453125
      ],
      "text": "discontinued PZA received the drug for between 85 and 112 days, again with minimal variation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        635.9262084960938,
        175.58938598632812,
        650.3692016601562
      ],
      "text": "between the regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.7700805664062,
        455.7985534667969,
        682.4301147460938
      ],
      "text": "Regimen composition, dosing of component medicines and frequency",
